  <name>pluto-tx</name>
  <summary>SDR transceiver for PlutoSDR, HackRF and RTL-SDR</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Transmitter, receiver with waterfall, headless CLI and a browser interface (Web-TRX)
    for amateur radio with the ADALM-Pluto, HackRF One and RTL-SDR, built on GNU Radio.</p>
    <p>Modes: FM, SSB, FreeDV/RADE, M17, FT8, JS8, PSK31, RTTY, POCSAG, LoRa (Meshtastic, MeshCore),
    Digitext and file broadcast.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">pluto-tx.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/jochenhammes/pluto-tx</url>
